exports[`modal shell DOM is unchanged by the primitive > BulkPermissionsModal — open with a selection 1`] = `"<div class="fixed inset-0 z-[90] flex items-center justify-center overscroll-contain p-4 bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm"><div class="w-full max-w-2xl h-[86vh] flex flex-col rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-2xl"><div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700"><h2 class="font-black text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">แก้ไขสิทธิ์หลายคนพร้อมกัน</h2><button class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 dark:hover:text-slate-200"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-y-auto overscroll-contain px-5 py-4 space-y-4"><div><div class="text-[13px] font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1">ผู้ใช้ที่จะถูกแก้ไข (1 คน)</div><div class="max-h-28 overflow-y-auto rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 p-2 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-sky-100 dark:bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-800 dark:text-sky-200 text-[12px] font-medium break-all">alice</span></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[12px] text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-500/30 rounded-lg p-2.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><span>สิทธิ์ที่ติ๊กจะกลายเป็นสิทธิ์ทั้งหมดของทุกคนที่เลือก — ที่ไม่ติ๊กจะถูกเอาออก ไม่ใช่การเพิ่มทับของเดิม</span></div><div class="space-y-3"><div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 p-3"><div class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400 mb-2">แดชบอร์ด</div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-1.5"><label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="accent-primary-500"><span>ข้อมูล Dashboard</span></label></div></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 p-3"><div class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400 mb-2">จัดการทั่วไป</div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-1.5"><label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="accent-primary-500" checked=""><span>ช่องทาง</span></label><label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer"><input type="checkbox" class="accent-primary-500"><span>ตรวจสอบสลิป</span></label></div></div></div></div><div class="px-5 py-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700"><div class="flex justify-end gap-2"><button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-600 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">ยกเลิก</button><button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold bg-sky-600 hover:bg-sky-500 text-white">หน้าถัดไป</button></div></div></div></div>"`;

